&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Part of Building the Future&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dremio is the unified lakehouse platform for self-service analytics and AI, serving hundreds of global enterprises, including Maersk, Amazon, Regeneron, NetApp, and S&amp;amp;P Global. Customers rely on Dremio for cloud, hybrid, and on-prem lakehouses to power their data mesh, data warehouse migration, data virtualization, and unified data access use cases. Based on open source technologies, including Apache Iceberg and Apache Arrow, Dremio provides an open lakehouse architecture enabling the fastest time to insight and platform flexibility at a fraction of the cost.&amp;nbsp; Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://www.dremio.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://www.Dremio.com&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;www.dremio.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;About the role&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive (AE) at Dremio, you will be focused on selling primarily Next Gen Dremio Cloud (SaaS) but also self-managed Dremio Software to enterprise customers (4,000+ employees).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a pipeline-driven, outbound-oriented SaaS sales role. While inbound interest and marketing support exist, success in this role requires consistent self-sourced pipeline generation through outbound prospecting, targeted account outreach, and partner-led motions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Account Executives at Dremio own the full sales cycle—from pipeline creation through close. Enterprise AEs at Dremio sell into complex environments where customers may require SaaS, self-managed software, or a hybrid approach based on security, regulatory, or operational needs. AEs are expected to operate with urgency, discipline, and accountability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve sales quotas for allocated accounts on a quarterly and annual basis by developing a sales strategy in the allocated territory with a target prospect list, and a regional territory plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own pipeline generation through outbound prospecting, account-based outreach, partner motions, and targeted campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively build and manage account plans for your customer accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the trusted advisor to the customer by understanding their existing and future IT roadmap to drive the Dremio solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace AI sales tools to drive prospecting and customer strategies for success. Develop Points of View (POV) for customer engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect qualification and the development of new sales opportunities and ongoing revenue streams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arrange and conduct Executive and CxO discussions and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales process management and opportunity closure with Salesforce.com and Clari.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing account management to ensure customer satisfaction and drive additional revenue streams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be familiar with solution-based selling, have experience managing a complex sales process, and possess excellent presentation, listening, organization, and contact management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain healthy pipeline coverage through consistent outbound activity, driving to exceed 3x coverage ratios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute 6–12 month SaaS sales cycles with strong deal velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead structured discovery, qualification, demos, and close processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Solutions Architects as needed to support technical validation while maintaining momentum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accurately manage pipeline, forecasting, and CRM hygiene&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-10 years of experience in pipeline-driven SaaS sales roles, managing and closing your own deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to self-source pipeline consistently, not rely solely on inbound leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success closing $150K–$1+ million ARR SaaS deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in carrying and achieving $1.6+ million Annual Recurring Revenue (ARR) quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong outbound prospecting, discovery, and qualification skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-activity, high-ownership mindset with strong execution discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, high-growth environment with high energy/positive attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication, presentation, and relationship management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with consumption-based or cloud-native SaaS models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with lakehouses, data warehouses, analytics, AI, and/or modern data platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to open-source ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-New-York&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we value&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Dremio, we hold ourselves to high standards when it comes to People, Thinking, and Action. Our Gnarlies (that&#39;s what we call our employees) communicate with clarity, drive accountability, and are respectful towards each other. We confront brutal facts and focus on results while operating with a sense of urgency and building a &quot;flywheel&quot;. People who like to jump in and drive momentum will thrive in our #GnarlyLife.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Dremio is an equal opportunity employer supporting workforce diversity. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender identity, sexual orientation, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other unlawful factor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Dremio is committed to providing any necessary accommodations for individuals with disabilities within our application and interview process. To request accommodation due to a disability, please inform your recruiter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Dremio has policies in place to protect the personal information that employees and applicants disclose to us. Please click &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1CB96QFmOX-bFy48YFOe2GO5lmdawOpKKBj8DpTgsuNg/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;here&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; to review the privacy notice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important Security Notice for Candidates&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Dremio, we uphold trust and transparency as paramount values in all our interactions with customers, partners, employees, and the general public. We have been targeted by individuals creating fake domains similar to ours to scam prospects and candidates. Please note that all official communications from us will be from an @dremio.com domain. If you suspect you&#39;ve been targeted by a scam, it&#39;s imperative to report the incident to your local law enforcement agencies. For more information about this type of scam, please refer to Dremio&#39;s official statement&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dremio.com/blog/stay-alert-for-fraudulent-recruitment-attempts-that-falsely-claim-association-with-dremio/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dremio is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes and will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with the Company.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

lsvp-frontera-health:greenhouse:51468990.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Frontera is reimagining how children with autism and other behavioral health needs get the care they deserve. We bring together world-class clinicians, technologists, and autism specialists to build cutting-edge AI tools that help care teams work smarter and spend more time with the children and families who need them most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform is HIPAA-compliant and designed for the real-world needs of behavioral health teams - from psychologists to ABA therapists. By combining evidence-based care with powerful technology, we’re expanding access to high-quality services for families everywhere.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Frontera exists to close the care gap: every child, no matter where they live, should be able to access effective behavioral healthcare.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a high-ownership Strategic Finance Lead to help build the financial backbone of Frontera as we scale across healthcare services, technology, and emerging health-system business models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of strategic finance, accounting oversight, revenue visibility, and business partnership. The right person will bring strong financial modeling and business analysis skills, healthcare business model fluency, and enough accounting depth to ensure our financial reporting is accurate, explainable, and decision-useful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with Finance, Operations, Product, Commercial, and Clinical leadership to improve forecasting, revenue and margin visibility, unit economics, and operating decision-making across Frontera’s hybrid services + technology model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-leverage finance role for someone who can operate close to the business, build scalable finance infrastructure, and help leadership understand what is driving performance across a complex healthcare + AI operating model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Finance &amp;amp; Business Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance and executive leadership to build and maintain financial models that support operating decisions, scenario planning, board reporting, and investor-facing narratives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze performance across Frontera’s healthcare services, technology, direct-to-parent, and commercial partnership models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate financial and operational data into clear insights for leaders across Operations, Product, Commercial, and Clinical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support budgeting, forecasting, headcount planning, margin analysis, pricing analysis, and ROI analysis for strategic initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define the financial metrics that matter most for each business line, including revenue growth, utilization, payer mix, gross margin, contribution margin, operating leverage, and unit economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a strong business partner to functional leaders by bringing analytical rigor, intellectual curiosity, and practical recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help leadership identify where performance is improving, where the model is breaking down, and what actions are needed to improve results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue, Margin &amp;amp; Business Model Visibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build clean, consistent reporting across multiple revenue models, including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B2B SaaS / platform contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct-to-consumer subscriptions and payments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clinical services revenue, including Medicaid, commercial payers, and private pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health-system, enterprise, or partnership-based models as Frontera expands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop clear views of revenue quality, gross margin, contribution margin, and unit economics across services, tech, and hybrid business lines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Payor Ops, Clinical Operations, Commercial, and Product teams to improve revenue visibility and resolve key financial reporting issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support analysis of payer mix, service line performance, utilization, pricing, collections, and margin improvement opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reporting that helps leaders understand performance by product, payer, customer type, region, and business segment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help connect operational drivers to financial outcomes so the business can make faster, better decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accounting Oversight &amp;amp; Financial Reporting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and/or oversee monthly, quarterly, and annual close processes, partnering with internal and external accounting resources to ensure timely, accurate financial reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure financial statements, reconciliations, revenue recognition, accruals, prepaids, deferred revenue, and key accounting judgments are accurate and explainable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strong understanding of accounting details while elevating financial reporting into clear business insight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with external accountants, tax advisors, and internal stakeholders on compliance, tax filings, audit readiness, and diligence support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accounting processes scale appropriately as Frontera grows across multiple entities, revenue streams, and business models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trust in the numbers without adding unnecessary complexity or slowing down the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems, Process &amp;amp; Finance Infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve financial reporting processes, billing workflows, documentation, and internal controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with tech, operations, clinical, commercial, and payor operations teams to improve source data quality and ensure financial reporting reflects business reality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement automation, tooling, and AI-enabled workflow improvements where ROI is clear and the business need is real&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use modern tools to reduce manual reporting work, improve data accuracy, and make financial insights easier for leaders to access and act on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build scalable reporting infrastructure that can support multiple revenue models, entities, and operating teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish practical internal controls appropriate for a Series A-stage company operating in regulated healthcare environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support audit readiness, investor diligence, board reporting, and financial data requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like in the First 12 Months&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership has a clear, trusted view of performance across services, technology, direct-to-parent, and partnership business models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenue and margin reporting is clean, explainable, and useful for operating decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly close is completed on a reliable timeline, with clear explanations of key variances and business drivers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Finance becomes a stronger business partner to Operations, Product, Commercial, and Clinical leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Key operating decisions are supported by timely financial analysis, clear recommendations, and strong judgment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontera has better visibility into unit economics, payer mix, utilization, gross margin, contribution margin, and operating leverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial reporting, accounting processes, and internal controls are credible for board reporting, investor diligence, and future audit readiness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The finance function is viewed not just as a reporting function, but as a strategic operating partner to the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 to 8 years of experience across strategic finance, corporate finance, investment banking, private equity, transaction advisory, finance consulting, accounting, or operating finance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare experience or strong healthcare business model fluency, ideally across digital health, healthcare services, payer/provider models, value-based care, health-system partnerships, or healthcare technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial modeling, forecasting, and business analysis skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze revenue, margins, unit economics, operating performance, and business line performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong accounting foundation and ability to understand financial statements, close processes, revenue recognition, accruals, reconciliations, and financial controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering cross-functionally with business leaders to translate financial and operational data into clear insights and recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using modern finance tools, automation, and AI-enabled workflows to improve speed, accuracy, and scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, with the ability to simplify complexity for executive, operational, and cross-functional audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership, high judgment, and comfort operating in ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operator mindset, with willingness to move between strategy, analysis, process-building, and hands-on execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Pluses&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 to 2 years of investment banking, private equity, transaction advisory, or finance/strategy consulting experience, ideally with healthcare exposure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a high-growth startup, especially Seed through Series B&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with hybrid business models that combine services, software, data, marketplace, payer, provider, or enterprise revenue streams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to investor materials, board reporting, fundraising support, M&amp;amp;A, or strategic planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with operators to drive margin improvement, revenue quality, utilization, pricing, payer mix, or growth decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare services experience, especially ABA, behavioral health, Medicaid, commercial payers, or provider operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building lightweight reporting, forecasting, or automation workflows using tools such as Excel/Google Sheets, BI tools, SQL, modern planning tools, or AI-enabled productivity tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS, subscription, or enterprise healthcare revenue exposure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CPA or formal accounting background is a plus, but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;We have determined a salary range for this position that takes into account several factors including experience, knowledge, education, skills, and abilities. Please note that the salary information is a general guideline and the exact salary will be determined based on the individual’s qualifications and experience, with consideration given to the factors listed above. &lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;All full-time employee benefits include a stake in shared success through stock options, health benefits, 401(k) plan, and 4 weeks of PTO per year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$150,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$170,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Frontera?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to be at the forefront of innovation in pediatric healthcare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on challenging and impactful projects that leverage cutting-edge technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a talented and passionate team in a fast-paced and dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make a real difference in the lives of children and families in rural communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and benefits package.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Denver Office &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dog-friendly office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Catered lunch from local Denver restaurants five days a week, plus occasional breakfasts and dinners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Robust snack program and great coffee options (including cappuccino machine and cold brew cans).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular team events and low-key socials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to $150/month commuter stipend, discounted nearby parking, and a discounted Colorado Athletic Club membership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thoughtfully designed space for focus, collaboration, and connection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive health benefits, stock options, 401(k), and generous PTO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us in building the future of behavioral healthcare!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

